/-- 00:L3, 14:P3 — the locus's numeral bracketed: `0.9498 < (π/4)/tanh(3π/8) < 0.9499`, the paper's `0.950`. -/
theorem locus_bracket : (0.9498 : ℝ) < (π / 4) / tanh (3 * π / 8) ∧ (π / 4) / tanh (3 * π / 8) < 0.9499 := by
