/-- 00:L3, 14:C7, 14:X3 — the landing bracketed: `0.68368 < tanh²(3π/8) < 0.68369` (the numeral `0.684`) is
certified from `π` to six places, `e` to nine and the Taylor tail; and, with the Planck numerals
